                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It was a pleasure visiting Newberry County Memorial Hospital and seeing the incredible work their staff is doing for our community.\n\nAs a nurse practitioner, I know how hard it can be for rural hospitals to keep their doors open. That\u2019s why I voted for the Rural Health Transformation Program to help small hospitals stay open and keep serving the communities that rely on them. \ud83d\udc99\ud83c\udfe5",
