                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Veterans struggling with mental health deserve more than a prescription, they deserve tools that reflect their values, beliefs, and experiences.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m leading the charge in Congress to urge the VA to embrace faith-based solutions that are proven to help.\n\nThis initiative is backed by over 20 veterans service organizations and a growing coalition of lawmakers across the country.\n\nRead the full press release here: https://t.co/hkNkK46l6D",
